# Runtime artifacts.
#
# The audit log and the checkpoint directory are written wherever
# aios runs. A run from the repository root puts them in ./var,
# which is outside aios-system/.gitignore, so they are ignored
# here as well.
var/

# Local secrets. A .env file holds API keys, and a key that
# reaches a commit is a key that has to be rotated.
.env
.env.*

# Local journey and probe output directories.
#
# Each of these holds the captured stdout of an `aios web` run,
# and that stdout carries the session token in the URL the server
# prints. The server itself calls that token a credential, and a
# future `git add .` would have swept it into a commit. The
# directories are regenerable -- they are the working area for the
# journey scripts -- so they are ignored rather than committed.
approval-journey/
browser-journey/
hole-egress/
hole-fix/
hole-gitcommit/
hole-memory/
rina-journey/
setup-journey/
